# No environment variables are required for local development.

# Legal pages of this installation. Set these and layerling shows the links on
# the start page and in Settings; leave them unset and no links appear. The
# pages themselves are not part of the project - drop impressum.html and
# datenschutz.html into apps/web/public/, where .gitignore keeps them out of Git.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IMPRINT_URL=/impressum.html
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVACY_URL=/datenschutz.html
# Optional, if the links should not read "Impressum" and "Datenschutz":
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IMPRINT_LABEL=Legal notice
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVACY_LABEL=Privacy
